# Shell clang-tidy policy: inherits the root config and adds the shell headers to the header filter.
# No checks are disabled by default. Where a PipeWire macro or C API makes a check unavoidable, the
# site carries a NOLINTNEXTLINE(check) with the reason; the SUMMARY lists every suppression.
---
InheritParentConfig: true
HeaderFilterRegex: '.*/src/(core|shell)/.*'
...
